{"seq":1,"slug":"cargo","title":"Cargo 与包管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/ecosystem/cargo","wordCount":731,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"cargo-与包管理\">Cargo 与包管理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Cargo 不只是构建工具，而是 Rust 工程化的<strong>事实标准入口</strong>：依赖解析、编译、测试、文档、发布、交叉编译都由它统一承载。理解本篇的关键，是把握 Cargo 的两个核心抽象——<strong>crate 与 feature</strong>：前者是编译与分发单位，后者是编译期可裁剪的能力开关。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>依赖版本由 <code>Cargo.lock</code> 锁定</strong>：库不提交锁文件（让使用者定版本），应用提交锁文件（保证部署可复现）。</li>\n<li><strong>Workspace 是规模化协作的答案</strong>：多 crate 共享依赖版本与编译缓存，避免同一依赖多版本共存。</li>\n<li><strong>feature 实现编译期裁剪</strong>：可选依赖配合 <code>#[cfg(feature = ...)]</code>，让使用者只为其需要的功能付费。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"cargo-核心功能\">Cargo 核心功能</h2><p>Cargo 是 Rust 的构建系统和包管理器，负责依赖管理、编译、测试、文档生成和发布。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>命令</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>常用选项</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>cargo new</code></td>\n<td>创建新项目</td>\n<td><code>--lib</code> 创建库项目</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cargo build</code></td>\n<td>编译项目</td>\n<td><code>--release</code> 优化编译</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cargo run</code></td>\n<td>编译并运行</td>\n<td><code>--example name</code> 运行示例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cargo test</code></td>\n<td>运行测试</td>\n<td><code>-- --nocapture</code> 显示输出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cargo doc</code></td>\n<td>生成文档</td>\n<td><code>--open</code> 自动打开浏览器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cargo bench</code></td>\n<td>运行基准测试</td>\n<td>需要 criterion 等框架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cargo clippy</code></td>\n<td>静态分析</td>\n<td><code>-- -W clippy::all</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cargo fmt</code></td>\n<td>代码格式化</td>\n<td><code>--check</code> 仅检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cargo publish</code></td>\n<td>发布到 crates.io</td>\n<td><code>--dry-run</code> 试运行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"cargo-toml-配置\">Cargo.toml 配置</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"[package]&#10;name = &quot;my-project&quot;&#10;version = &quot;0.1.0&quot;&#10;edition = &quot;2021&quot;&#10;authors = [&quot;作者 &lt;email@example.com&gt;&quot;]&#10;description = &quot;项目描述&quot;&#10;license = &quot;MIT&quot;&#10;repository = &quot;https://github.com/user/repo&quot;&#10;&#10;[dependencies]&#10;serde = { version = &quot;1.0&quot;, features = [&quot;derive&quot;] }&#10;tokio = { version = &quot;1&quot;, features = [&quot;full&quot;] }&#10;log = &quot;0.4&quot;&#10;&#10;[dev-dependencies]&#10;criterion = { version = &quot;0.5&quot;, features = [&quot;html_reports&quot;] }&#10;&#10;[build-dependencies]&#10;bindgen = &quot;0.69&quot;&#10;&#10;[features]&#10;default = [&quot;std&quot;]&#10;std = []&#10;async = [&quot;tokio&quot;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[package]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>name = \"my-project\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>version = \"0.1.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>edition = \"2021\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>authors = [\"作者 &#x3C;email@example.com>\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>description = \"项目描述\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>license = \"MIT\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>repository = \"https://github.com/user/repo\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[dependencies]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>serde = { version = \"1.0\", features = [\"derive\"] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tokio = { version = \"1\", features = [\"full\"] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>log = \"0.4\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[dev-dependencies]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>criterion = { version = \"0.5\", features = [\"html_reports\"] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[build-dependencies]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>bindgen = \"0.69\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[features]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>default = [\"std\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>std = []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async = [\"tokio\"]</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"workspace-多包项目\">Workspace 多包项目</h2><p>Workspace 允许在一个仓库中管理多个相关的 crate，共享依赖版本和编译缓存。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"# 根 Cargo.toml&#10;[workspace]&#10;members = [&#10;    &quot;crates/core&quot;,&#10;    &quot;crates/api&quot;,&#10;    &quot;crates/cli&quot;,&#10;]&#10;resolver = &quot;2&quot;&#10;&#10;[workspace.dependencies]&#10;serde = { version = &quot;1.0&quot;, features = [&quot;derive&quot;] }&#10;tokio = { version = &quot;1&quot;, features = [&quot;full&quot;] }&#10;anyhow = &quot;1.0&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 根 Cargo.toml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[workspace]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>members = [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"crates/core\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"crates/api\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"crates/cli\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>resolver = \"2\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[workspace.dependencies]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>serde = { version = \"1.0\", features = [\"derive\"] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tokio = { version = \"1\", features = [\"full\"] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>anyhow = \"1.0\"</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"# crates/core/Cargo.toml&#10;[package]&#10;name = &quot;my-core&quot;&#10;version = &quot;0.1.0&quot;&#10;edition = &quot;2021&quot;&#10;&#10;[dependencies]&#10;serde = { workspace = true }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># crates/core/Cargo.toml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[package]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>name = \"my-core\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>version = \"0.1.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>edition = \"2021\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[dependencies]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>serde = { workspace = true }</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;workspace 根&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;crates/core&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;crates/api&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;crates/cli&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|依赖| B&#10;    D --&gt;|依赖| B&#10;    D --&gt;|依赖| C\">graph TD\n    A[\"workspace 根\"] --&gt; B[\"crates/core\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"crates/api\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"crates/cli\"]\n    C --&gt;|依赖| B\n    D --&gt;|依赖| B\n    D --&gt;|依赖| C</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"features-条件编译\">Features 条件编译</h2><p>Features 允许按需启用功能，实现零成本的可选依赖。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"[features]&#10;default = [&quot;json&quot;]&#10;json = [&quot;serde_json&quot;]&#10;yaml = [&quot;serde_yaml&quot;]&#10;full = [&quot;json&quot;, &quot;yaml&quot;, &quot;async&quot;]&#10;async = [&quot;tokio&quot;]&#10;&#10;[dependencies]&#10;serde_json = { version = &quot;1.0&quot;, optional = true }&#10;serde_yaml = { version = &quot;0.9&quot;, optional = true }&#10;tokio = { version = &quot;1&quot;, optional = true, features = [&quot;full&quot;] }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[features]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>default = [\"json\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>json = [\"serde_json\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>yaml = [\"serde_yaml\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>full = [\"json\", \"yaml\", \"async\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async = [\"tokio\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[dependencies]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>serde_json = { version = \"1.0\", optional = true }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>serde_yaml = { version = \"0.9\", optional = true }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tokio = { version = \"1\", optional = true, features = [\"full\"] }</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"#[cfg(feature = &quot;json&quot;)]&#10;pub fn parse_json(input: &amp;str) -&gt; Result&lt;Value, serde_json::Error&gt; {&#10;    serde_json::from_str(input)&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[cfg(feature = &quot;yaml&quot;)]&#10;pub fn parse_yaml(input: &amp;str) -&gt; Result&lt;Value, serde_yaml::Error&gt; {&#10;    serde_yaml::from_str(input)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#[cfg(feature = \"json\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub fn parse_json(input: &#x26;str) -> Result&#x3C;Value, serde_json::Error> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    serde_json::from_str(input)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[cfg(feature = \"yaml\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub fn parse_yaml(input: &#x26;str) -> Result&#x3C;Value, serde_yaml::Error> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    serde_yaml::from_str(input)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"build-script\">Build Script</h2><p><code>build.rs</code> 在编译前执行，常用于代码生成、链接 C 库、环境检测。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// build.rs&#10;fn main() {&#10;    println!(&quot;cargo:rerun-if-changed=src/proto/api.proto&quot;);&#10;&#10;    let git_hash = std::process::Command::new(&quot;git&quot;)&#10;        .args([&quot;rev-parse&quot;, &quot;--short&quot;, &quot;HEAD&quot;])&#10;        .output()&#10;        .map(|o| String::from_utf8_lossy(&amp;o.stdout).trim().to_string())&#10;        .unwrap_or_else(|_| &quot;unknown&quot;.to_string());&#10;&#10;    println!(&quot;cargo:rustc-env=GIT_HASH={}&quot;, git_hash);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// build.rs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"cargo:rerun-if-changed=src/proto/api.proto\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let git_hash = std::process::Command::new(\"git\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .args([\"rev-parse\", \"--short\", \"HEAD\"])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .output()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .map(|o| String::from_utf8_lossy(&#x26;o.stdout).trim().to_string())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .unwrap_or_else(|_| \"unknown\".to_string());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"cargo:rustc-env=GIT_HASH={}\", git_hash);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// src/main.rs&#10;fn main() {&#10;    println!(&quot;版本: {} ({})&quot;, env!(&quot;CARGO_PKG_VERSION&quot;), env!(&quot;GIT_HASH&quot;));&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// src/main.rs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"版本: {} ({})\", env!(\"CARGO_PKG_VERSION\"), env!(\"GIT_HASH\"));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"依赖管理最佳实践\">依赖管理最佳实践</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>实践</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>使用 <code>cargo update</code> 更新锁文件</td>\n<td><code>Cargo.lock</code> 保证可复现构建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库项目不提交 <code>Cargo.lock</code></td>\n<td>让使用者决定版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>应用项目提交 <code>Cargo.lock</code></td>\n<td>保证部署一致性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>使用 <code>cargo audit</code> 检查漏洞</td>\n<td>扫描已知安全漏洞</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最小化 feature 依赖</td>\n<td>减少编译时间和二进制大小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>workspace.dependencies 统一版本</td>\n<td>避免同一依赖多版本共存</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"有用的-cargo-插件\">有用的 Cargo 插件</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>插件</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>安装</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>cargo-edit</code></td>\n<td>命令行添加/删除依赖</td>\n<td><code>cargo install cargo-edit</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cargo-watch</code></td>\n<td>文件变更自动重编译</td>\n<td><code>cargo install cargo-watch</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cargo-expand</code></td>\n<td>展开宏</td>\n<td><code>cargo install cargo-expand</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cargo-deny</code></td>\n<td>依赖许可证和安全审查</td>\n<td><code>cargo install cargo-deny</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cargo-bloat</code></td>\n<td>分析二进制大小</td>\n<td><code>cargo install cargo-bloat</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cargo-nextest</code></td>\n<td>更快的测试运行器</td>\n<td><code>cargo install cargo-nextest</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cargo-release</code></td>\n<td>自动化发布流程</td>\n<td><code>cargo install cargo-release</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"交叉编译\">交叉编译</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 添加目标&#10;rustup target add x86_64-unknown-linux-musl&#10;&#10;# 编译静态链接的 Linux 二进制&#10;cargo build --release --target x86_64-unknown-linux-musl&#10;&#10;# 使用 cross 工具（Docker 交叉编译）&#10;cargo install cross&#10;cross build --release --target aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 添加目标</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rustup</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> x86_64-unknown-linux-musl</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 编译静态链接的 Linux 二进制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --release</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> x86_64-unknown-linux-musl</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 使用 cross 工具（Docker 交叉编译）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cross</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cross</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --release</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>目标平台</th>\n<th>Target Triple</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Linux（动态链接）</td>\n<td><code>x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu</code></td>\n<td>默认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Linux（静态链接）</td>\n<td><code>x86_64-unknown-linux-musl</code></td>\n<td>无运行时依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>macOS ARM</td>\n<td><code>aarch64-apple-darwin</code></td>\n<td>Apple Silicon</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Windows</td>\n<td><code>x86_64-pc-windows-msvc</code></td>\n<td>MSVC 工具链</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WebAssembly</td>\n<td><code>wasm32-unknown-unknown</code></td>\n<td>浏览器/WASI</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Cargo 统一了依赖管理、构建、测试、文档与发布，是 Rust 工程化的标准入口。</li>\n<li><code>Cargo.lock</code> 区分使用场景：应用提交以固定部署版本，库不提交以让使用者决定。</li>\n<li>Workspace 让多 crate 项目共享依赖版本与 <code>target/</code> 缓存，<code>workspace.dependencies</code> 避免版本分裂。</li>\n<li>Features 实现编译期裁剪，配合 <code>#[cfg(feature = ...)]</code> 让可选功能不增加无关成本。</li>\n<li><code>build.rs</code> 与 Cargo 插件（<code>nextest</code>、<code>deny</code>、<code>bloat</code> 等）覆盖代码生成、安全审查与产物分析。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Cargo 与包管理","id":"cargo-与包管理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Cargo 核心功能","id":"cargo-核心功能"},{"level":2,"text":"Cargo.toml 配置","id":"cargo-toml-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"Workspace 多包项目","id":"workspace-多包项目"},{"level":2,"text":"Features 条件编译","id":"features-条件编译"},{"level":2,"text":"Build Script","id":"build-script"},{"level":2,"text":"依赖管理最佳实践","id":"依赖管理最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"有用的 Cargo 插件","id":"有用的-cargo-插件"},{"level":2,"text":"交叉编译","id":"交叉编译"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"性能优化与基准测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/systems-programming/performance-benchmarking"},"next":{"title":"WebAssembly 与 Rust","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/ecosystem/wasm"}}